//
// Inputs (the transform holds a * b without wrap-around iff n + m - 1 <= 2^lg):
//   Padded{x, n}   x[i] < 2p; readable and zero up to max(n rounded up to 8, 2^lg / 2)
//   Bounded{x, n}  x[i] < 2p; no word past n is read
